s":[{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":[7]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImpactSEGSToMaskBatch"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":9,"type":"Note","pos":[452.9169068195026,347.47398067780347],"size":[700,420],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"为什么必须用两个独立模型","properties":{"text":""},"widgets_values":["同一个 -seg 模型的框和掩码来自同一个预测头，\n掩码外接框基本等于检测框 → 重叠率恒为 1，校验等于没做。\n\n所以：\n  出框方 hand_yolov8n     —— 独立模型，负责找候选\n  验证方 PitHandDetailer  —— 独立模型，负责判这里到底有没有手\n\n判定逻辑：框内被分割掩码覆盖的比例\n  ≥ min_overlap(默认 15%) → 通过\n  真手通常 40~70%，误检接近 0%\n\n输出仍是 BBOX_DETECTOR，所以重绘区域保持为 bbox 矩形，\n不会被换成分割掩码。参数调法：\n  真手被误杀 → min_overlap 降到 0.08\n  还有误检   → 升到 0.25~0.30\n\n依赖：comfyui-impact-pack + ultralytics 模型"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":7,"type":"MaskToImage","pos":[1274.428152171162,452.7859239144191],"size":[240,60],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"mask","type":"MASK","link":7}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[8]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MaskToImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":8,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[1624.3806361434686,59.27246941689145],"size":[631.0361805819443,649.2250259934157],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":8}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"title":"通过验证的手部区域","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]}],"links":[[1,1,0,4,0,"IMAGE"],[2,2,0,4,1,"BBOX_DETECTOR"],[3,3,1,4,2,"SEGM_DETECTOR"],[4,4,0,5,0,"BBOX_DETECTOR"],[5,1,0,5,1,"IMAGE"],[6,5,0,6,0,"SEGS"],[7,6,0,7,0,"MASK"],[8,7,0,8,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.8406557709091581,"offset":[-534.2022897959356,169.6128838455522]}},"version":0.4}